        "title": "Adoption Matrix",
        "difficulty": "easy",
        "description": "<p data-start=\"23\" data-end=\"129\">As the lead analyst for the Detective Club's new aquatic conservation program, you were tasked with calculating adoption fees for their unique initiative. The Oceanic Aquarium partnership allowed detectives to symbolically adopt marine species while funding tracking research, but the billing system needed to account for a 10% operational surcharge on each adoption.<br /><br />You are given two tables, 'detectives' and 'species', representing data for an animal tracking agency.</p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"133\" data-end=\"226\">The 'detectives' table contains 'detective_id' and 'name', representing each detective.</li>\n<li data-start=\"229\" data-end=\"386\">The 'species' table includes 'species_id', 'species_name', and 'base_fee', representing each animal species and the base fee charged for tracking it.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"388\" data-end=\"522\">Each detective can be assigned to track any species, and the agency applies a 10% surcharge on the 'base_fee' when assigning a task.</p>\n<p data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"652\">Write a query to compute the final fee (after applying the 10% surcharge) each detective would charge for tracking each species.</p>\n<p data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"823\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The final output should include the columns 'name', 'species_name', and 'final_fee', sorted by 'name' in ascending order and 'species_name' in ascending order.</p>",
        "schema": "CREATE TABLE detectives (\n  detective_id INT PRIMARY KEY,\n  name VARCHAR(100)\n);\nCREATE TABLE species (\n  species_id INT PRIMARY KEY,\n  species_name VARCHAR(100),\n  base_fee DECIMAL(7,2)\n);\nINSERT INTO detectives VALUES\n  (101, 'Falcon'),\n  (102, 'Raven');\nINSERT INTO species VALUES\n  (101, 'Jellyfish',  15.00),\n  (102, 'Octopus',    35.00),\n  (103, 'Turtle',     40.00);\n\n",
        "slug": "adoption-matrix",
        "originalCategory": "joins",
        "tags": ["Mathematics, Counting","Cross Join"],
        "sample_testcases": [{"input":"CREATE TABLE detectives (\n  detective_id INT PRIMARY KEY,\n  name VARCHAR(100)\n);\nCREATE TABLE species (\n  species_id INT PRIMARY KEY,\n  species_name VARCHAR(100),\n  base_fee DECIMAL(7,2)\n);\nINSERT INTO detectives VALUES\n  (101, 'Falcon'),\n  (102, 'Raven');\nINSERT INTO species VALUES\n  (101, 'Jellyfish',  15.00),\n  (102, 'Octopus',    35.00),\n  (103, 'Turtle',     40.00);\n\n","output":"name\tspecies_name\tfinal_fee\nFalcon\tJellyfish\t16.50\nFalcon\tOctopus\t38.50\nFalcon\tTurtle\t44.00\nRaven\tJellyfish\t16.50\nRaven\tOctopus\t38.50\nRaven\tTurtle\t44.00\n","explanation":"<p>detectives:</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>detective_id</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>name</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>101</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>Falcon</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>102</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>Raven</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>species:</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>species_id</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>species_name</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>base_fee</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>101</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>Jellyfish</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>15.00</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>102</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>Octopus</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>35.00</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>103</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>Turtle</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>40.00</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"},{"input":"CREATE TABLE detectives (\n  detective_id INT PRIMARY KEY,\n  name VARCHAR(100)\n);\nCREATE TABLE species (\n  species_id INT PRIMARY KEY,\n  species_name VARCHAR(100),\n  base_fee DECIMAL(7,2)\n);\nINSERT INTO detectives VALUES\n  (1, 'Holmes'),\n  (2, 'Marple'),\n  (3, 'Poirot');\nINSERT INTO species VALUES\n  (1, 'Clownfish',  25.00),\n  (2, 'Seahorse',   30.00),\n  (3, 'Starfish',   20.00);\n\n","output":"name\tspecies_name\tfinal_fee\nHolmes\tClownfish\t27.50\nHolmes\tSeahorse\t33.00\nHolmes\tStarfish\t22.00\nMarple\tClownfish\t27.50\nMarple\tSeahorse\t33.00\nMarple\tStarfish\t22.00\nPoirot\tClownfish\t27.50\nPoirot\tSeahorse\t33.00\nPoirot\tStarfish\t22.00\n","explanation":"<p>detectives:</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>detective_id</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>name</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>1</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>Holmes</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>2</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>Marple</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>3</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>Poirot</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>species:</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>species_id</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>species_name</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>base_fee</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>1</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>Clownfish</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>25.00</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>2</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>Seahorse</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>30.00</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>3</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>Starfish</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>20.00</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"}]
