        "title": "All or Nothing",
        "difficulty": "medium",
        "description": "<p class=\"\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"346\">You and your friend Rahul, a game designer at PlayZone, need to understand which players engage with all game levels and which haven&rsquo;t started any. Management wants a list of players who have either attempted every level or not played any level. This insight will help identify highly engaged players and those who may need onboarding assistance.</p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"350\" data-end=\"462\">The &lsquo;player&rsquo; table contains the columns &lsquo;id&rsquo;, &lsquo;name&rsquo;. &lsquo;id&rsquo; is primary key; each row describes a unique player.</li>\n<li data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"684\">The &lsquo;games&rsquo; table contains the columns &lsquo;game_id&rsquo;, &lsquo;level_id&rsquo;, &lsquo;player_id&rsquo;. &lsquo;game_id&rsquo; is primary key; &lsquo;level_id&rsquo; references &lsquo;levels&rsquo;, &lsquo;player_id&rsquo; references &lsquo;player&rsquo;, and each row records a player&rsquo;s session on a level.</li>\n<li data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"814\">The &lsquo;levels&rsquo; table contains the columns &lsquo;level_id&rsquo;, &lsquo;level_name&rsquo;. &lsquo;level_id&rsquo; is primary key; each row describes a game level.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"925\">Your task is to list all players who have played either every level available or have not played any level.</p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"1001\">The output columns should be &lsquo;id&rsquo; and &lsquo;name&rsquo;, ordered by &lsquo;id&rsquo;</p>",
        "schema": "CREATE TABLE player (id INT PRIMARY KEY, name VARCHAR(100));\nCREATE TABLE levels (level_id INT PRIMARY KEY, level_name VARCHAR(100));\nCREATE TABLE games (game_id INT PRIMARY KEY, level_id INT, player_id INT);\nINSERT INTO player VALUES (1, 'Alice'), (2, 'Bob'), (3, 'Charlie');\nINSERT INTO levels VALUES (1, 'Intro'), (2, 'Forest'), (3, 'Castle');\nINSERT INTO games VALUES (1, 1, 1), (2, 2, 1), (3, 3, 1), (4, 1, 3);",
        "slug": "all-or-nothing",
