        "description": "<p data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"220\">You are given two tables, 'hosts' and 'policies', which track information about insurance policies linked to various hosts.</p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"224\" data-end=\"325\">The 'hosts' table includes the columns 'host_id' and 'name'. Each row represents a unique host.</li>\n<li data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"504\">The 'policies' table includes the columns 'policy_id', 'host_id', and 'premium_amount'. Each row represents a policy and its associated premium amount for a given host.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"639\">Write a query to calculate the total premium amount paid by each host. Based on the total premium, assign a risk category as follows:</p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"713\">If the total is more than 2000, the host is classified as 'Low Risk'.</li>\n<li data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"795\">If the total is between 1001 and 2000 (inclusive), classify as 'Medium Risk'.</li>\n<li data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"835\">Otherwise, classify as 'High Risk'.</li>\n<li data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"907\">If a host has no associated policies, treat their total premium as 0.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"1086\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The final output should include the columns 'name', 'total_premium', and 'risk_category', sorted by total_premium in descending order and then name in ascending order.</p>",
        "schema": "CREATE TABLE hosts (\n  host_id INT PRIMARY KEY,\n  name VARCHAR(100)\n);\nCREATE TABLE policies (\n  policy_id INT PRIMARY KEY,\n  host_id INT,\n  premium_amount DECIMAL(10,2)\n);\nINSERT INTO hosts VALUES\n  (101, 'Blake Tune'),\n  (102, 'Riley Vox'),\n  (103, 'Casey Rhythm');\nINSERT INTO policies VALUES\n  (101, 101, 1500.00),\n  (102, 101, 700.00),\n  (103, 102, 1200.00),\n  (104, 102, 900.00),\n  (105, 103, 400.00);\n\n",
        "slug": "premium-waves",
        "originalCategory": "joins",
        "tags": ["case when","JOIN Operation"],
        "sample_testcases": [{"input":"CREATE TABLE hosts (\n  host_id INT PRIMARY KEY,\n  name VARCHAR(100)\n);\nCREATE TABLE policies (\n  policy_id INT PRIMARY KEY,\n  host_id INT,\n  premium_amount DECIMAL(10,2)\n);\nINSERT INTO hosts VALUES\n  (101, 'Blake Tune'),\n  (102, 'Riley Vox'),\n  (103, 'Casey Rhythm');\nINSERT INTO policies VALUES\n  (101, 101, 1500.00),\n  (102, 101, 700.00),\n  (103, 102, 1200.00),\n  (104, 102, 900.00),\n  (105, 103, 400.00);\n\n","output":"name\ttotal_premium\trisk_category\nBlake Tune\t2200.00\tLow Risk\nRiley Vox\t2100.00\tLow Risk\nCasey Rhythm\t400.00\tHigh Risk\n","explanation":"<p>hosts:</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>host_id</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>name</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>101</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>Blake Tune</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>102</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>Riley Vox</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>103</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>Casey Rhythm</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>policies:</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>policy_id</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>host_id</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>premium_amount</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>101</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>101</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>1500.00</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>102</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>101</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>700.00</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>103</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>102</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>1200.00</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>104</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>102</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>900.00</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>105</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>103</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>400.00</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"},{"input":"CREATE TABLE hosts (\n  host_id INT PRIMARY KEY,\n  name VARCHAR(100)\n);\nCREATE TABLE policies (\n  policy_id INT PRIMARY KEY,\n  host_id INT,\n  premium_amount DECIMAL(10,2)\n);\nINSERT INTO hosts VALUES\n  (1, 'Morgan Sky'),\n  (2, 'Alex Echo'),\n  (3, 'Jamie Pulse');\nINSERT INTO policies VALUES\n  (1, 1, 1200.00),\n  (2, 1, 950.00),\n  (3, 2, 500.00),\n  (4, 2, 600.00),\n  (5, 3, 300.00),\n  (6, 3, 200.00),\n  (7, 3, 100.00);\n\n","output":"name\ttotal_premium\trisk_category\nMorgan Sky\t2150.00\tLow Risk\nAlex Echo\t1100.00\tMedium Risk\nJamie Pulse\t600.00\tHigh Risk\n","explanation":"<p>hosts:</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>host_id</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>name</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>1</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>Morgan Sky</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>2</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>Alex Echo</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>3</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>Jamie Pulse</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>policies:</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>policy_id</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>host_id</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>premium_amount</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>1</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>1</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>1200.00</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>2</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>1</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>950.00</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>3</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>2</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>500.00</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>4</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>2</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>600.00</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>5</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>3</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>300.00</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>6</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>3</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>200.00</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>7</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>3</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"115\">\n<p><strong>100.00</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"}]
